message: "If you use this knowledge base, its ontology, or its prompt library in research or a product write-up, cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Cross-Border E-Commerce AI Skills: a trilingual knowledge base, domain ontology, and agent runtime"
abstract: "69 chapters in Chinese, English and Japanese on AI for cross-border e-commerce operations; a domain ontology of 100 entities, 322 platform constraints, 78 relations and 8 processes across 15 platforms; 878 prompts that declare their data requirements; 9 agent skills served over MCP; and an operations runtime with human approval on every write. Factual claims are dated and verified in CI."
